eam/apps/2541520/extras/ee7ec168e74af8a242cc377863d1be82.mp4?t=1744967921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 5 maps available for exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541520/extras/664edbd5ad2e826b1f36edc2ef83fe9c.poster.avif?t=1744967921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541520/extras/664edbd5ad2e826b1f36edc2ef83fe9c.webm?t=1744967921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541520/extras/664edbd5ad2e826b1f36edc2ef83fe9c.mp4?t=1744967921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience immersion with realistic graphics, high interactivity and fine tuned sounds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541520/extras/598b3ec82e0466552e8481b0b0582d43.poster.avif?t=1744967921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541520/extras/598b3ec82e0466552e8481b0b0582d43.webm?t=1744967921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541520/extras/598b3ec82e0466552e8481b0b0582d43.mp4?t=1744967921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice is recognized and understood by the monster and can even be stolen and used against your team!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 difficulties including custom one to tailor your own experience.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space is Deep and Dark place to go alone. So, bring friends, or join open lobbies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541520/extras/329392902bff2a567a98b7bc1d4d667e.poster.avif?t=1744967921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541520/extras/329392902bff2a567a98b7bc1d4d667e.webm?t=1744967921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541520/extras/329392902bff2a567a98b7bc1d4d667e.mp4?t=1744967921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
